    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.poster.avif?t=1732202598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.webm?t=1732202598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.mp4?t=1732202598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Reinforced Machine is a fast-paced twin-stick arcade action game where players can choose and control a Reinforced Machine to battle against legions of cyborg creatures. Assign a skill and equip your mech with a weapon of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Reinforced Machine has its own unique skill. It can transform to a bigger and more powerful mech, granting you control of a legendary weapon to deliver mayhem to your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/7387600f60e54414860626a9f1807c78.avif?t=1732202598\" data-has-big /></span>Choose from several Reinforced Machines matching your playstyle. Syntax, Mecha-Simian,\u00a0 Pylon, Firewall and counting!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.poster.avif?t=1732202598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.webm?t=1732202598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.mp4?t=1732202598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Reinforced Machine is a fast-paced twin-stick arcade action game where players can choose and control a Reinforced Machine to battle against legions of cyborg creatures. Assign a skill and equip your mech with a weapon of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Reinforced Machine has its own unique skill. It can transform to a bigger and more powerful mech, granting you control of a legendary weapon to deliver mayhem to your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/7387600f60e54414860626a9f1807c78.avif?t=1732202598\" data-has-big /></span>Choose from several Reinforced Machines matching your playstyle. Syntax, Mecha-Simian,\u00a0 Pylon, Firewall and counting!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fast-paced arcade-style mayhem. Play a Reinforced Machine and equip it with a weapon of your choice. Transform to a bigger and more powerful mech, granting you control of a legendary weapon to deliver destruction to your enemies. Improve your skills and study your enemies' weaknesses to win!",
